{"headword":"שָׁבַת","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> cease, desist, rest <strong>(</strong>Assyrian <em>šabâtu</em>, prob. <em>cease, be completed</em> Dl<sup>WB</sup> Zim<sup>KAT3. 593</sup> (Jen<sup>ZA iv (1889), 277 f.</sup> is sceptical); Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">سَبَتَ</span> <em>cut off, interrupt;</em> NH has <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁבֶת</span> <em>neglect</em>, etc., Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁבְתָּא</span> <em>cost of neglect</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:3\" href=\"/Genesis.2.3\">Gn 2:3</a> +; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁבָ֑תוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:14\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.14\">La 5:14</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁבּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:4\" href=\"/Hosea.7.4\">Ho 7:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁבֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.10\">Pr 22:10</a> + 2 times; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁבֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.35\">Lv 26:35</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁבַּת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.34\">34</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.3\">Ne 6:3</a> +, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>cease:</em> (abs. 13 times) of seasons <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:22\" href=\"/Genesis.8.22\">Gn 8:22</a> (J); manna <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:12\" href=\"/Joshua.5.12\">Jos 5:12</a> (P), etc., <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.4\">Is 14:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.3\">Ne 6:3</a> +; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:4\" href=\"/Hosea.7.4\">Ho 7:4</a> + 3 times"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>desist</em> from labour, <em>rest:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> (of God) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:2\" href=\"/Genesis.2.2\">Gn 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:3\" href=\"/G